      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i just dont think it's that serious since i dont have a fever or anything. it just looks really red and angry. if i take a bunch of ibuprofen and some hydrocortisone cream to bring the swelling down, do u think that would help manage it until i can actually find a way to see someone? i really just want to know if there's something i can do right now to make it stop hurting.",
